    <string name="settings_watch_12v">Watch 12V while the car sleeps</string>
    <string name="settings_watch_quick_note">Every 30 minutes (or your choice), Ocean Live briefly connects to the adapter, reads the 12V and disconnects so the adapter can sleep again. The car\'s network isn\'t touched, so the car stays asleep.</string>
